{"seq":3,"slug":"memory-leak-detection","title":"内存泄漏检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/memory-optimization/memory-leak-detection","wordCount":1053,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"内存泄漏检测\">内存泄漏检测</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>内存泄漏（Memory Leak）是指程序分配的内存在不再需要后未被正确释放，导致可用内存持续减少。内存泄漏是长期运行服务（Web 服务器、数据库、后台任务）的头号稳定性威胁。与崩溃不同，内存泄漏是<strong>渐进式的</strong>——可能在几天甚至几周后才触发 OOM Kill，而且问题发生时往往已经远离了泄漏的根因。检测和预防内存泄漏需要专门的工具和系统化的方法。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[内存泄漏] --&gt; B[增长型泄漏]&#10;    A --&gt; C[一次性泄漏]&#10;    B --&gt; D[持续增长,最终 OOM]&#10;    C --&gt; E[泄漏量固定,影响有限]&#10;    A --&gt; F[逻辑泄漏]&#10;    F --&gt; G[内存可达但不再使用]&#10;    B --&gt; H[重点关注]&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[监控 + 检测工具]\">graph TB\n    A[内存泄漏] --&gt; B[增长型泄漏]\n    A --&gt; C[一次性泄漏]\n    B --&gt; D[持续增长,最终 OOM]\n    C --&gt; E[泄漏量固定,影响有限]\n    A --&gt; F[逻辑泄漏]\n    F --&gt; G[内存可达但不再使用]\n    B --&gt; H[重点关注]\n    F --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[监控 + 检测工具]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>泄漏类型</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>严重程度</th>\n<th>常见原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>持续增长泄漏</td>\n<td>RSS 持续线性或阶梯增长</td>\n<td>致命</td>\n<td>循环中遗漏 free/close</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一次性泄漏</td>\n<td>仅在初始化时泄漏</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>全局对象未清理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逻辑泄漏</td>\n<td>内存可达但永不使用</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>缓存无上限、事件监听器未移除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>碎片化假象</td>\n<td>RSS 高但使用率正常</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>分配器碎片化，非真正泄漏</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"c-c-泄漏检测工具\">C/C++ 泄漏检测工具</h2><p>C/C++ 没有垃圾回收器，内存管理完全由程序员负责。这使得泄漏检测工具成为必需品。</p>\n<p><strong>Valgrind (Memcheck)</strong> 是最经典的内存错误检测工具。它通过二进制插桩跟踪每一次分配和释放，程序退出时报告所有未释放的内存块：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"valgrind --leak-check=full --show-leak-kinds=all --track-origins=yes ./myapp&#10;&#10;# 输出示例:&#10;# ==12345== 48 bytes in 3 blocks are definitely lost in loss record 1 of 5&#10;# ==12345==    at 0x4C2FB0F: malloc (in /usr/lib/valgrind/vgpreload_memcheck.so)&#10;# ==12345==    by 0x401234: create_node (tree.c:42)&#10;# ==12345==    by 0x401456: insert (tree.c:78)&#10;# ==12345==    by 0x401678: main (main.c:15)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">valgrind</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --leak-check=full</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --show-leak-kinds=all</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --track-origins=yes</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./myapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 输出示例:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ==12345== 48 bytes in 3 blocks are definitely lost in loss record 1 of 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ==12345==    at 0x4C2FB0F: malloc (in /usr/lib/valgrind/vgpreload_memcheck.so)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ==12345==    by 0x401234: create_node (tree.c:42)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ==12345==    by 0x401456: insert (tree.c:78)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ==12345==    by 0x401678: main (main.c:15)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Valgrind 的分类系统：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>definitely lost</strong>: 没有任何指针指向该内存——确定泄漏</li>\n<li><strong>indirectly lost</strong>: 通过已泄漏的指针才能到达——间接泄漏</li>\n<li><strong>possibly lost</strong>: 有指向内存块内部（非起始位置）的指针——可能泄漏</li>\n<li><strong>still reachable</strong>: 程序退出时仍有指针指向——通常不是问题</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>AddressSanitizer (ASan)</strong> 是编译器内建的内存检测工具（GCC/Clang），比 Valgrind 快 2-5 倍，但需要重新编译：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 编译时启用&#10;gcc -fsanitize=address -fno-omit-frame-pointer -g -O1 myapp.c -o myapp&#10;# 启用泄漏检测&#10;ASAN_OPTIONS=detect_leaks=1 ./myapp\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 编译时启用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gcc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -fsanitize=address</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -fno-omit-frame-pointer</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -g</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -O1</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp.c</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 启用泄漏检测</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ASAN_OPTIONS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">detect_leaks</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ./myapp</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>LeakSanitizer (LSan)</strong> 可以独立使用，也可以与 ASan 结合。它使用更轻量的方式检测泄漏：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"gcc -fsanitize=leak -g myapp.c -o myapp&#10;./myapp\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gcc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -fsanitize=leak</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -g</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp.c</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">./myapp</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>速度</th>\n<th>精度</th>\n<th>需要重编译</th>\n<th>其他能力</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Valgrind Memcheck</td>\n<td>10-50x 减速</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>越界访问、未初始化读取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AddressSanitizer</td>\n<td>2-3x 减速</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>堆缓冲区溢出、UAF</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LeakSanitizer</td>\n<td>~1x (几乎无减速)</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>仅泄漏检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Heaptrack</td>\n<td>5-10x 减速</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>分配热点分析</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"gc-语言中的内存泄漏\">GC 语言中的内存泄漏</h2><p>即使在有垃圾回收器的语言（Java、Go、JavaScript、Python）中，内存泄漏仍然存在——只是形式不同。GC 语言中的泄漏通常是<strong>逻辑泄漏</strong>：对象仍然被引用但永远不会再被使用。</p>\n<p><strong>Java</strong> 中常见的泄漏模式和检测方法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// 泄漏模式 1: 集合类只增不减&#10;class EventBus {&#10;    private final List&lt;EventListener&gt; listeners = new ArrayList&lt;&gt;();&#10;&#10;    public void register(EventListener listener) {&#10;        listeners.add(listener);&#10;    }&#10;    // 缺少 unregister 方法 → 监听器永远不会被 GC&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 泄漏模式 2: 静态集合持有对象引用&#10;class Cache {&#10;    private static final Map&lt;String, byte[]&gt; cache = new HashMap&lt;&gt;();&#10;&#10;    public static void put(String key, byte[] data) {&#10;        cache.put(key, data);  // 无上限、无淘汰 → 持续增长&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 泄漏模式 3: ThreadLocal 未清理&#10;class RequestContext {&#10;    private static final ThreadLocal&lt;Map&lt;String, Object&gt;&gt; context =&#10;        ThreadLocal.withInitial(HashMap::new);&#10;&#10;    public static void set(String key, Object value) {&#10;        context.get().put(key, value);&#10;    }&#10;    // 线程池场景下，线程被复用，ThreadLocal 数据不断积累&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 泄漏模式 1: 集合类只增不减</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EventBus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> final</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> List&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">EventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> listeners </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ArrayList&#x3C;>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> register</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(EventListener </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">listener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        listeners.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(listener);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 缺少 unregister 方法 → 监听器永远不会被 GC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 泄漏模式 2: 静态集合持有对象引用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Cache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> final</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Map&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">byte</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]> cache </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> HashMap&#x3C;>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> put</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(String </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">byte</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        cache.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">put</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key, data);  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 无上限、无淘汰 → 持续增长</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 泄漏模式 3: ThreadLocal 未清理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RequestContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> final</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ThreadLocal&#x3C;Map&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>> context </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ThreadLocal.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">withInitial</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(HashMap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">::new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(String </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, Object </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        context.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">put</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key, value);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 线程池场景下，线程被复用，ThreadLocal 数据不断积累</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# Java Heap Dump 分析&#10;jmap -dump:format=b,file=heap.hprof $(pgrep java)&#10;# 使用 Eclipse MAT 或 VisualVM 分析 heap dump&#10;# 关注 &quot;Dominator Tree&quot; 和 &quot;Leak Suspects&quot; 报告\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Java Heap Dump 分析</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">jmap</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -dump:format=b,file=heap.hprof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pgrep</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> java</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 使用 Eclipse MAT 或 VisualVM 分析 heap dump</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 关注 \"Dominator Tree\" 和 \"Leak Suspects\" 报告</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Go</strong> 中使用 pprof 分析内存：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"import _ &quot;net/http/pprof&quot;&#10;&#10;// 采集堆内存 profile&#10;// curl http://localhost:6060/debug/pprof/heap &gt; heap.pb.gz&#10;// go tool pprof -http=:8080 heap.pb.gz&#10;&#10;// 对比两个时间点的 heap profile 找增长点&#10;// go tool pprof -base heap1.pb.gz heap2.pb.gz\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _ </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">net/http/pprof</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 采集堆内存 profile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// curl http://localhost:6060/debug/pprof/heap > heap.pb.gz</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// go tool pprof -http=:8080 heap.pb.gz</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 对比两个时间点的 heap profile 找增长点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// go tool pprof -base heap1.pb.gz heap2.pb.gz</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>JavaScript/Node.js</strong> 中常见泄漏源是闭包、事件监听器和全局变量：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const EventEmitter = require(&#39;events&#39;);&#10;&#10;class Connection extends EventEmitter {&#10;  constructor() {&#10;    super();&#10;    this.buffer = Buffer.alloc(1024 * 1024);&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;function createConnections() {&#10;  const connections = [];&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; 1000; i++) {&#10;    const conn = new Connection();&#10;    conn.on(&#39;data&#39;, (data) =&gt; {&#10;      console.log(conn.buffer.length); // 闭包持有 conn 引用&#10;    });&#10;    connections.push(conn);&#10;  }&#10;  // connections 数组被清空，但事件监听器的闭包仍持有引用&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> EventEmitter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> require</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'events'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Connection</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> extends</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EventEmitter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.buffer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Buffer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">alloc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1024</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1024</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createConnections</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> connections</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> conn</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Connection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    conn.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'data'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(conn.buffer.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 闭包持有 conn 引用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    connections.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(conn);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // connections 数组被清空，但事件监听器的闭包仍持有引用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph GC 语言泄漏模式&#10;        A[集合只增不减] --&gt; D[对象永远可达]&#10;        B[事件监听器未移除] --&gt; D&#10;        C[闭包持有外部引用] --&gt; D&#10;        E[缓存无上限] --&gt; D&#10;        F[ThreadLocal 未清理] --&gt; D&#10;    end&#10;    D --&gt; G[GC 无法回收]&#10;    G --&gt; H[RSS 持续增长]\">graph TB\n    subgraph GC 语言泄漏模式\n        A[集合只增不减] --&gt; D[对象永远可达]\n        B[事件监听器未移除] --&gt; D\n        C[闭包持有外部引用] --&gt; D\n        E[缓存无上限] --&gt; D\n        F[ThreadLocal 未清理] --&gt; D\n    end\n    D --&gt; G[GC 无法回收]\n    G --&gt; H[RSS 持续增长]</pre><h2 id=\"生产环境泄漏监控\">生产环境泄漏监控</h2><p>在生产环境中，不能运行 Valgrind 或 ASan（开销太大）。需要依赖<strong>轻量级监控</strong>来发现泄漏。</p>\n<p>核心监控指标：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>RSS</strong>（Resident Set Size）：进程实际占用的物理内存</li>\n<li><strong>VSZ</strong>（Virtual Size）：进程的虚拟内存总量</li>\n<li><strong>堆内存增量</strong>：一段时间内堆内存的净增长</li>\n<li><strong>GC 压力</strong>：GC 频率、GC 暂停时间、GC 后存活对象大小</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 实时监控进程内存（Linux）&#10;watch -n 1 &#39;ps -p $(pgrep myapp) -o pid,rss,vsz,pcpu --no-headers&#39;&#10;&#10;# 使用 /proc 获取详细内存信息&#10;cat /proc/$(pgrep myapp)/status | grep -E &quot;VmRSS|VmSize|VmSwap&quot;&#10;&#10;# 使用 smem 获取 PSS（比 RSS 更准确地反映进程实际消耗）&#10;smem -p -s pss | head -20\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 实时监控进程内存（Linux）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">watch</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ps -p $(pgrep myapp) -o pid,rss,vsz,pcpu --no-headers'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 使用 /proc 获取详细内存信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /proc/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pgrep</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> grep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -E</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"VmRSS|VmSize|VmSwap\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 使用 smem 获取 PSS（比 RSS 更准确地反映进程实际消耗）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">smem</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pss</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> head</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -20</span></span></code></pre></div><p>自动化泄漏检测的策略：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# Prometheus 告警规则示例&#10;groups:&#10;  - name: memory_leak_detection&#10;    rules:&#10;      - alert: PossibleMemoryLeak&#10;        expr: |&#10;          deriv(process_resident_memory_bytes[1h]) &gt; 10 * 1024 * 1024&#10;        for: 2h&#10;        labels:&#10;          severity: warning&#10;        annotations:&#10;          summary: &#39;进程内存持续增长超过 10MB/小时，持续 2 小时&#39;&#10;&#10;      - alert: HighMemoryUsage&#10;        expr: |&#10;          process_resident_memory_bytes / node_memory_MemTotal_bytes &gt; 0.8&#10;        for: 10m&#10;        labels:&#10;          severity: critical&#10;        annotations:&#10;          summary: &#39;进程内存使用超过物理内存 80%&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Prometheus 告警规则示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">groups</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">memory_leak_detection</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">alert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">PossibleMemoryLeak</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        expr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          deriv(process_resident_memory_bytes[1h]) > 10 * 1024 * 1024</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">2h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">warning</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        annotations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          summary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'进程内存持续增长超过 10MB/小时，持续 2 小时'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">alert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">HighMemoryUsage</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        expr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          process_resident_memory_bytes / node_memory_MemTotal_bytes > 0.8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">10m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">critical</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        annotations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          summary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'进程内存使用超过物理内存 80%'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>泄漏排查的工作流程：发现 RSS 持续增长 → 确认不是正常增长（如缓存预热）→ 获取两个时间点的 heap dump → 对比分析新增的大对象 → 追踪引用链找到根因 → 修复并验证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((内存泄漏检测))&#10;    C/C++ 工具&#10;      Valgrind&#10;      AddressSanitizer&#10;      LeakSanitizer&#10;      Heaptrack&#10;    GC 语言泄漏&#10;      集合只增不减&#10;      事件监听器&#10;      闭包引用&#10;      缓存无上限&#10;    生产监控&#10;      RSS/VSZ 趋势&#10;      GC 压力指标&#10;      Prometheus 告警&#10;      Heap Dump 对比&#10;    预防策略&#10;      RAII/defer/using&#10;      弱引用&#10;      缓存淘汰策略&#10;      代码审查检查清单\">mindmap\n  root((内存泄漏检测))\n    C/C++ 工具\n      Valgrind\n      AddressSanitizer\n      LeakSanitizer\n      Heaptrack\n    GC 语言泄漏\n      集合只增不减\n      事件监听器\n      闭包引用\n      缓存无上限\n    生产监控\n      RSS/VSZ 趋势\n      GC 压力指标\n      Prometheus 告警\n      Heap Dump 对比\n    预防策略\n      RAII/defer/using\n      弱引用\n      缓存淘汰策略\n      代码审查检查清单</pre><ul>\n<li>内存泄漏是长期运行服务的首要稳定性威胁，<strong>渐进式退化</strong>使其难以及时发现</li>\n<li>C/C++ 使用 <strong>Valgrind</strong> 或 <strong>AddressSanitizer</strong> 检测泄漏，两者互补（Valgrind 精确但慢，ASan 快但需重编译）</li>\n<li>GC 语言的泄漏本质是<strong>逻辑泄漏</strong>——对象可达但不再使用，常见于集合、监听器和闭包</li>\n<li>生产环境通过 <strong>RSS 趋势监控</strong> + <strong>告警规则</strong>主动发现泄漏，通过 <strong>heap dump 对比</strong>定位根因</li>\n<li>预防泄漏比检测泄漏更重要——使用 RAII/defer 模式、设置缓存上限、及时移除事件监听器</li>\n<li>泄漏排查的核心方法：<strong>两个时间点的快照对比</strong> → 找到持续增长的对象类型 → 追踪引用链</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"内存泄漏检测","id":"内存泄漏检测"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"C/C++ 泄漏检测工具","id":"c-c-泄漏检测工具"},{"level":2,"text":"GC 语言中的内存泄漏","id":"gc-语言中的内存泄漏"},{"level":2,"text":"生产环境泄漏监控","id":"生产环境泄漏监控"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"分配策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/memory-optimization/allocation-strategies"},"next":{"title":"磁盘 I/O 优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/io-optimization/disk-io-optimization"}}